.idea/

# --- Project data never travels with the harness ---
# Everything under project/ is per-project working state: intake material, the spec,
# the backlog, WP specs and prompts, Codex replies, acceptance checks, the morning
# report. It is wiped or replaced between projects and must never be committed.
# Only the scaffolding that tells the user what goes where is tracked.
# Cross-project memory lives in LESSONS.md at the repo root, which IS tracked.
project/*
!project/intake/
project/intake/*
!project/intake/README.md
!project/checks/
project/checks/*
!project/checks/README.md
!project/wps/
project/wps/*
!project/wps/.keep
